# Drop your 3D model files here.

#

# SUPPORTED FORMATS:

# building.glb — recommended (GLB/GLTF, supports textures + animations)

# building.obj — convert to .glb first for best results

#

# HOW TO PLACE FILES:

# Copy your .glb file to this folder and name it: building.glb

# Full path: frontend/android/app/src/main/assets/models/building.glb

#

# The app loads: file:///android_asset/models/building.glb

# If not found: a procedural demo building is shown automatically

#

# CONVERT .obj → .glb:

# Option 1 (Blender): File > Import > Wavefront (.obj) → File > Export → glTF 2.0 (.glb)

# Option 2 (Online): https://products.aspose.app/3d/conversion/obj-to-gltf

# Option 3 (CLI): npx obj2gltf -i building.obj -o building.glb
